<%# The EDM version an exchange was conducted in, as a row of a detail table —
    an exchange's own, and an event's, which it holds from the exchange it names.

    Nothing where none was ever settled: an empty column does not say which
    version the exchange would have run under, and an empty « Version » row would
    read as a version missing rather than as a choice that never happened.
    Nothing either for an event whose exchange does not exist. %>
<% if exchange&.specification %>
  <tr>
    <th scope="row"><%= t('admin.journal.exchanges.attributes.specification') %></th>
    <td><code><%= exchange.specification %></code></td>
  </tr>
<% end %>
